                                "sense_id": "788a77aa-e90f-34af-8aac-605d9d0479cf",
                                "text": "On this floor is spread in places matting made of bamboo grass. On this matting many of the natives throw down a cotton blanket, or possibly a thin mattress, for beds. Some have a rude bed made of four posts sixteen inches high with crossheads and side pieces pinned together and then cris-crossed with bed cords."
